TITLE Albite kinetics pH2 200C with Fe2/Fe3 and H2S(g)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    Fe(2) 4e-3
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.tsv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities Na+ Al+3 AlOH+2 AlF+2 AlSO4+ Al(OH)2+ Al(OH)3 Al(OH)4- Fe+2 Fe+3 HS- H2S SO4-2
    -totals Na Al Fe S
END
